n{aligned}z & =x+\\text{i}y \\\\  & =1+3\\text{i}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo write it in the form $z=r{\\text{e}}^{\\text{i}\\theta },$ where $r=|z|$ and $\\theta =\\operatorname{arg}⁡(z),$ we first calculate $r:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r=|z| & =\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{1}^{2}+{3}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{10}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since $z$ lies in the first quadrant, we can find the angle $\\theta $ as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\theta =\\operatorname{arg}⁡(z) & =\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{y}{x}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(3) \\\\  & ≈1.249.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting $r=\\sqrt{10}$ and $\\theta =1.249$ into $z=r{e}^{\\text{i}\\theta },$ we get \n\n$$\nz=\\sqrt{10}\\,{\\text{e}}^{1.249\\,\\text{i}}.\n$$" 13194139533921 true] [17592186266062 1000 #edb/ref 17592186266063 13194139533921 true] [17592186266062 1000 #edb/ref 17592186266064 13194139533921 true] [17592186266062 1000 #edb/ref 17592186266065 13194139533921 true] [17592186266062 1000 #edb/ref 17592186266066 13194139533921 true] [17592186266062 1000 #edb/ref 17592186266067 13194139533921 true] [17592186266062 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533921 true] [17592186266062 1041 "selection" 13194139533921 true] [17592186266062 1104 #edb/ref 17592186266065 13194139533921 true] [17592186266062 1110 #uuid "1501bd7a-f354-5e48-8fba-2ed39fca47df" 13194139533921 true] [17592186266063 1034 "z=\\sqrt{10}\\,{\\text{e}}^{2\\pi \\text{i}/3}" 13194139533921 true] [17592186266063 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533921 true] [17592186266063 1111 #uuid "58b3d4e1-b419-5c68-9f70-67ede4505082" 13194139533921 true] [17592186266064 1034 "z=\\sqrt{5}\\,{\\text{e}}^{1.429\\,\\text{i}}" 13194139533921 true] [17592186266064 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533921 true] [17592186266064 1111 #uuid "bc9fb541-9791-5b91-9543-760cddbc25d2" 13194139533921 true] [17592186266065 1034 "z=\\sqrt{10}\\,{\\text{e}}^{1.249\\,\\text{i}}" 13194139533921 true] [17592186266065 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 1