145 "To write our complex number in the form $z=r{\\text{e}}^{\\text{i}\\theta },$ where $r=|z|$ and $\\theta =\\operatorname{arg}⁡(z),$ we first calculate $r:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r=|z| & =\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(-3)^{2}+(-3)^{2}} \\\\  & =3\\sqrt{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since $z$ lies in the third quadrant, we can find the angle $\\theta $ as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\theta =\\operatorname{arg}⁡(z) & =\\pi +|\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{y}{x})| \\\\  & =\\pi +|\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{-3}{-3})| \\\\  & =\\pi +|\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(1)| \\\\  & =\\pi +\\frac{\\pi }{4} \\\\  & =\\frac{5\\pi }{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting $r=3\\sqrt{2}$ and $\\theta =\\frac{5\\pi }{4}$ into $z=r{e}^{\\text{i}\\theta },$ we get \n\n$$\nz=3\\sqrt{2}\\,{\\text{e}}^{5\\pi \\text{i}/4}.\n$$" 13194139533921 true] [17592186266076 1000 #edb/ref 17592186266077 13194139533921 true] [17592186266076 1000 #edb/ref 17592186266078 13194139533921 true] [17592186266076 1000 #edb/ref 17592186266079 13194139533921 true] [17592186266076 1000 #edb/ref 17592186266080 13194139533921 true] [17592186266076 1000 #edb/ref 17592186266081 13194139533921 true] [17592186266076 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533921 true] [17592186266076 1041 "selection" 13194139533921 true] [17592186266076 1104 #edb/ref 17592186266078 13194139533921 true] [17592186266076 1110 #uuid "f30eda78-02c2-5957-a436-8bcb280f7bf3" 13194139533921 true] [17592186266077 1034 "z=3\\sqrt{3}\\,{\\text{e}}^{\\pi \\text{i}/2}" 13194139533921 true] [17592186266077 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533921 true] [17592186266077 1111 #uuid "aaa51c64-ec76-5069-8aa8-70ab4a996d77" 13194139533921 true] [17592186266078 1034 "z=3\\sqrt{2}\\,{\\text{e}}^{5\\pi \\text{i}/4}" 13194139533921 true] [17592186266078 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533921 true] [17592186266078 1111 #uuid "2f572805-2e17-5000-b52c-9cbc56ef2476" 13194139533921 true] [17592186266079 1034 "z=3\\sqrt{2}\\,{\\text{e}}^{\\pi \\